sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as NotificationController
  participant Service as NotificationService
  participant Repo as NotificationRepository

  User->>Web: Open notifications
  Web->>Api: GET /api/v1/me/notifications
  Api->>Service: listMyNotifications(userId)
  Service->>Repo: Query recipient notifications
  Repo-->>Service: Notifications
  Service-->>Api: Notification list
  Api-->>Web: 200 OK
  User->>Web: Mark one as read
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/me/notifications/{id}/read
  Api->>Service: markRead(userId, notificationId)
  Service->>Repo: Update read state
  Api-->>Web: 204 No Content
